WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
Speaker 1: I know when I tell you the following&nbsp;
headline, many of you will say, Is this a rerun,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:14.220
David? Is this a 2020 episode or a 2021 episode?&nbsp;
No, it is almost October of 2022. And 61% of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:24.600
Republicans still think that Donald Trump actually&nbsp;
won the 2020 presidential election. It is almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:33.900
October of 2022. Monmouth poll shows, according&nbsp;
to NBC News, that nearly a third of all Americans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:44.820
including six in ten Republicans, continue to hold&nbsp;
the debunked belief that President Joe Biden did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:52.800
