a new Monmouth University poll released the day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:57.600
before the January six committee was going to&nbsp;
hold a hearing because of the hurricane. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:05.700
January six committee has canceled today's hearing&nbsp;
just as an FBI. 29% of all respondents, as well as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:16.200
61% of Republicans say that Joe Biden won due to&nbsp;
voter fraud due to voter fraud. Can you imagine?&nbsp;&nbsp;

