These numbers have been relatively consistent over&nbsp;
time. If you look at the chart, you see that late&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:31.860
in 2020 and throughout most of 2021, about 32%&nbsp;
of all Americans believed Biden won due to voter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:44.040
