These are incredible numbers that the world sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:51.960
and says, what the hell is going on in the United&nbsp;
States? And they are right to ask that question.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.680 --> 00:02:02.100
You really. How do you share a country&nbsp;
and how do you run a government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:10.620
split with individuals who believe the system&nbsp;
only works when they win? That's fundamentally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:16.560
what this is. You know, many of you wrote to&nbsp;
